  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "etw: Fix operator precedence in SMB event dispatch",
  "description": "In event_callback() the provider/event-ID test mixed && and || without grouping. Because && binds tighter than ||, the condition parsed as\n\n```\n((smbclient || smbserver) && Id == 40000) || Id == 2000\n```\n\nso an event from any provider whose Id was 2000 was routed to etw_dump_write_smb_event() (and then silently dropped), while genuine SMB events were handled inconsistently.\n\nParenthesize the two Id comparisons so the intended grouping applies:\n\n```\n(smbclient || smbserver) && (Id == 40000 || Id == 2000)\n```\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Claude Code, Claude Opus 4.8)",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2026-05-31T10:06:20.411Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-31T13:00:00.204Z",
